Paso 1. Basic de cabecera: ZI_LP_PagoCab

En ADT: botón derecho en tu paquete → New → Other ABAP Repository Object → Core Data Services → Data Definition. Nombre ZI_LP_PAGOCAB, plantilla Define View Entity.

abap
@AccessControl.authorizationCheck: #NOT_REQUIRED
@EndUserText.label: 'Listado de pagos - Datos de pago (REGUH)'
@ObjectModel.usageType: {
  serviceQuality: #C,
  sizeCategory:   #XL,
  dataClass:      #TRANSACTIONAL
}
/*
  Cabecera del pago (REGUH) + Comprobante de egreso (BKPF-XBLNR del doc. de pago).
  El original hacía SELECT SINGLE xblnr FROM bkpf WHERE belnr = reguh-vblnr
  (sin BUKRS ni GJAHR -> no determinista). Aquí se une por sociedad pagadora,
  número de documento de pago y fecha de contabilización (ZALDT = BUDAT del pago).
*/
define view entity ZI_LP_PagoCab
  as select from    reguh
    left outer join bkpf on  bkpf.bukrs = reguh.zbukr
                         and bkpf.belnr = reguh.vblnr
                         and bkpf.budat = reguh.zaldt
{
  key reguh.laufd as PaymentRunDate,
  key reguh.laufi as PaymentRunId,
  key reguh.xvorl as IsProposalRun,
  key reguh.zbukr as PayingCompanyCode,
  key reguh.lifnr as Supplier,
  key reguh.kunnr as Customer,
  key reguh.empfg as PayeeCode,
  key reguh.vblnr as PaymentDocument,
      reguh.zaldt as PaymentPostingDate,
      reguh.waers as PaymentCurrency,
      reguh.name1 as Name1,
      reguh.stras as Street,
      reguh.ort01 as City,
      reguh.regio as Region,
      reguh.stcd1 as TaxNumber1,
      reguh.znme1 as PayeeName,
      reguh.bnkl1 as BankKey,
      reguh.bnkn1 as BankAccount,
      reguh.koinh as AccountHolder,
      bkpf.xblnr  as PaymentReference
}

Activa con Ctrl+F3.

